<h1>Janeway's OBGYN Association</h1>
<div class="card">
  <p><strong>CS340 Project Final</strong></p>
  <p>Welcome to Janeway's OBGYN Association database management system!</p>
  <p>This web application provides a user-friendly interface for managing all records and data relating to appointments
    between patients and providers at our clinic locations.</p>
  <p>This application utilizes On Delete Restrict functionality to prevent accidental deletion of historical data.
    Banner messages will appear if a user attempts to delete a record that is referenced by the Appointments or Provider Locations tables.
    In order to delete a record that is referenced by another table, the user must either update or delete the referencing record(s) first.</p>
</div>

<div class="card">
  <p><strong>UI Pages Included</strong></p>
  <ul>
    <li>Patients</li>
    <li>Appointment Types</li>
    <li>Providers</li>
    <li>Clinics</li>
    <li>Appointments (M:N transaction table)</li>
    <li>Provider Locations (M:N intersection table)</li>
  </ul>
  <p class="small-note">Step 5 includes working CRUD routes, shared modal-based actions, and in-page error banners for failed actions.</p>
</div>
